{"html": "<div class=\"why-section\" id=\"whyA3i\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <span class=\"section-tag\">Why A3i</span>\n            <h2>Optimize AI. Build Local. Scale Impact.</h2>\n            <p>One platform of Apps, Ants and Agents that quietly does the work your team shouldn&#x27;t have to.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"why-grid\">\n            <article class=\"why-card why-1\">\n              <span class=\"why-ico\"><i class=\"fas fa-gauge-high\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span>\n              <h3 class=\"why-head\">Minimize cost through optimizing AI</h3>\n              <p class=\"why-body\">We match each task to the leanest model that does it well — optimized AI, not just more AI — so you get the result without paying for overkill.</p>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"why-card why-2\">\n              <span class=\"why-ico\"><i class=\"fas fa-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span>\n              <h3 class=\"why-head\">Reduce time without disruption</h3>\n              <p class=\"why-body\">Apps, Ants and Agents drop into the tools you already use, so work speeds up from day one — no rip-and-replace, nothing to relearn.</p>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"why-card why-3\">\n              <span class=\"why-ico\"><i class=\"fas fa-scale-balanced\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span>\n              <h3 class=\"why-head\">Responsible use and scale</h3>\n              <p class=\"why-body\">Guardrails, human oversight and audit trails are built in — so you can roll AI out wider with confidence, not risk.</p>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"why-clients\">\n            <p class=\"why-clients-label\">Built for teams like yours</p>\n            <div class=\"why-clients-row\">\n              <span class=\"why-client\"><i class=\"fas fa-building-columns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Hedge Funds</span>\n              <span class=\"why-client\"><i class=\"fas fa-hand-holding-dollar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Financial Advisors</span>\n              <span class=\"why-client\"><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Restaurants</span>\n              <span class=\"why-client\"><i class=\"fas fa-stethoscope\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Clinics</span>\n              <span class=\"why-client\"><i class=\"fas fa-house\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Real Estate</span>\n              <span class=\"why-client\"><i class=\"fas fa-bell-concierge\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Hospitality</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>"}